                    <h1 class="title" id="page-title">
          LibreOffice Portable Stable        </h1>
                          <div class="tabs">
                  </div>
                          <div class="region region-content">
    <div id="block-system-main" class="block block-system">

    
  <div class="content">
    <article id="node-54208" class="node node-app node-full clearfix" role="article">

      
  
  <div class="content clearfix">
    <div class="field field-name-field-app-header-and-download field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><img alt="" src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/LibreOfficePortable_128.png" height="128" width="128" class="main-app-logo"><h2 class="tagline">full-featured office suite</h2><div class="download-box"><a href="/redir2/?a=LibreOfficePortable&s=s&p=https://download.documentfoundation.org/libreoffice/portable/26.2.4/&d=pb&f=LibreOfficePortable_26.2.4_MultilingualStandard.paf.exe" style="display:block;width:313px;height:66px;border-radius:4px;padding:15px 17px 17px;color:white;font-family:Arimo;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: left;background-color: #197f19;" onclick="gtag('event', 'Download', { 'event_category': 'App',   'event_label': 'LibreOfficePortable' });"><img style="width:34px;height:34px;margin-right:11px;display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;" src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/_download_silhouette_34px.png"><p style="font-size:16px;padding: 0;margin: 0;color: white;font-weight: bold;display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;line-height: normal;">Download From Publisher</p></a><p class="download-info">Version 26.2.4 for Windows x64, Multilingual-Standard<br />213MB download / 681-800MB installed<br /><a href="#app-notes">Standard vs All</a> | <a href="#app-notes">Notes</a> | <a href="/support/antivirus?n=LibreOffice Portable Stable%20(Multilingual%20Standard)&a=LibreOfficePortable&v=26.2.4&f=LibreOfficePortable_26.2.4_MultilingualStandard.paf.exe&h=4bde93374aef4409243505b20d16561a4628ac7591457dd01fc6e1ccf571ba65">Antivirus Scan</a> | <a href="#app-notes">Fonts</a> | <a href="#download_details">Details</a></p></div><div class="download-box"><a href="/redir2/?a=LibreOfficePortable&s=s&p=https://download.documentfoundation.org/libreoffice/portable/26.2.4/&d=pb&f=LibreOfficePortable_26.2.4_MultilingualAll.paf.exe" style="display:block;width:313px;height:66px;border-radius:4px;padding:15px 17px 17px;color:white;font-family:Arimo;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: left;background-color: #197f19;" onclick="gtag('event', 'Download', { 'event_category': 'App',   'event_label': 'LibreOfficePortable' });"><img style="width:34px;height:34px;margin-right:11px;display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;" src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/_download_silhouette_34px.png"><p style="font-size:16px;padding: 0;margin: 0;color: white;font-weight: bold;display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;line-height: normal;">Download From Publisher</p></a><p class="download-info">Version 26.2.4 for Windows x64, Multilingual-All<br />281MB download / 900-1400MB installed<br /><a href="#app-notes">Standard vs All</a> | <a href="#app-notes">Notes</a> | <a href="/support/antivirus?n=LibreOffice Portable Stable%20(Multilingual%20All)&a=LibreOfficePortable&v=26.2.4&f=LibreOfficePortable_26.2.4_MultilingualAll.paf.exe&h=297dd083640ec06679dd7996a16323308bdd92e641b9171c5ba2a27c52b5d4af">Antivirus Scan</a> | <a href="#app-notes">Fonts</a> | <a href="#download_details">Details</a></p></div><p class="app-platform-blurb">Runs <a href="/about/what_is_a_portable_app">anywhere (cloud, removable, local)</a> without 'installing'. Use the <a href="/download">PortableApps.com Platform</a> for <a href="/platform/features#appstore">easy installs</a> and <a href="/platform/features#updater">automatic updates</a>.</p><p class="app-platform-blurb">Also Available: <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-still">LibreOffice Portable Previous</a>, <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-legacy-win7">LibreOffice Portable Legacy 25.2 (Win 7/8.0)</a>, <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-legacy-5.4">LibreOffice Portable Legacy 5.4 (Win XP/Vista)</a>, <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-legacy-7.5">LibreOffice Portable Legacy 7.5</a></p></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-field-app-features field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><p class="app-platform-blurb"><a href="/donate"><img src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/_button_-_donation_button.png" width="110" height="23" border="0" align="top" alt="Make a Donation"></a> - Support PortableApps.com development &amp; hosting, <a href="https://www.documentfoundation.org/contribution/"><img src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/_button_-_donation_button.png" width="110" height="23" border="0" align="top" alt="Make a Donation"></a> - Support LibreOffice development</p><h2>Description</h2><a href="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/LibreOfficePortable.png" class="colorbox-load" rel="lightbox"><img width="200" height="150" align="right" alt="" src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/LibreOfficePortable_small.png" class="screenshotthumbnail" /></a></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><p>LibreOffice Portable is a full-featured office suite -- including a word processor, spreadsheet, presentation tool, drawing package and database -- that's compatible with Microsoft Office, Word Perfect, Lotus and other office applications. It's easy-to-use and feature-rich, performing nearly all of the functions you'd expect in an office suite, but at no cost. Additional functionality including the Base database and document creation wizards is enabled by installing the jPortable portable Java runtime environment.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="field field-name-field-app-learn-more-donate-plat field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><p><a href="https://libreoffice.org/">Learn more about LibreOffice...</a></p></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-field-app-localizations field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-field-app-notes-display field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><h2><a name="app-notes""></a>App Notes</h2><p><strong>Standard vs All Languages</strong>: The standard download includes support for English (US and GB), Arabic (if available), Chinese (Simplified and Traditional), French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (Brazilian and Portugal), Russian, and Spanish.  The All Languages download includes all languages supported.  The Portable App Directory app store built into the PortableApps.com Platform will automatically select the right download for you.  An option during installation allows you to remove extra language templates, dictionaries, and other files to save you space.</p><p><strong>App Fonts Download</strong> - Some or all of the fonts that are normally packaged with this package are not included due to a bug within the Windows 10 Anniversary update that causes dynamically loaded fonts to take 10 times longer to load. The fonts are available as a <a href="https://downloads.sourceforge.net/portableapps/LibreOfficePortable_26.2.4_fonts.zip">direct download zip of fonts</a>. You add the fonts to the PortableApps.com Platform (recommended) by placing them in the PortableApps\PortableApps.com\Data\fonts directory.  You can also add the fonts directly to this app by placing them within the Data\fonts directory within the portable app's main directory.</p><p><strong>Offline Help</strong>: Offline help is available as an <a href="https://portableapps.com/downloading/?a=LibreOfficePortableOfflineHelp&s=s&p=&d=pa&n=LibreOffice%20Portable%20Offline%20Help&f=LibreOffice_Portable_Offline_Help_26.2.4_English.paf.exe">English-only add-on</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Non-ASCII Paths</strong>: LibreOffice will not run correctly when there are non-ASCII characters in its install path.</p>
<p><strong>Windows 7 Security Update</strong>: LibreOffice requires either the 2011 <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/topic/microsoft-security-advisory-insecure-library-loading-could-allow-remote-code-execution-486ea436-2d47-27e5-6cb9-26ab7230c704">KB2533623</a> or the 2015 <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/topic/ms15-063-vulnerability-in-windows-kernel-could-allow-elevation-of-privilege-june-9-2015-e3a28ab7-ef87-12a3-fdd4-c31f7dadd5fb">KB3063858</a> security update applied for Calc and some other functions to properly work due to <a href="https://bugs.python.org/issue36085">Python 3.8+ requiring it</a>. (<a href="https://wiki.documentfoundation.org/ReleaseNotes/7.1#Windows">LibreOffice notice</a>)</p></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-field-app-support field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><h2><a name="support"></a>Support</h2><p>For help with this app, please see the following:</p><ul class="support-links"><li><a href="/support/portable_app#downloading">Downloading a Portable App</a></li><li><a href="/support/portable_app#installing">Installing a Portable App</a></li><li><a href="/support/portable_app#using">Using a Portable App</a></li><li><a href="/support/portable_app#upgrading">Upgrading a Portable App</a></li><li><a href="/support/libreoffice_portable">Additional portable-specific help topics for this app...</a></li><li>External: <a href="https://www.libreoffice.org/get-help/documentation/">Publisher Documentation</a></li><li>External: <a href="https://www.libreoffice.org/get-help/community-support/">Publisher Support</a></li><li>PortableApps.com Forum: <a href="/forums/support/libreoffice_portable">Portable App Support</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-field-app-download-details field-type-computed field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><h2><a name="download_details"></a>Download Details</h2><a href="https://opensource.org/"><img width="120" height="150" src="https://cdn2.portableapps.com/_icon_-_open_source_initiative_approved_120x150.png" alt="Open Source Initiative Approved License" style="float:right;" /></a><ul class="download-details"><li><strong>Publisher</strong>: <a href="https://www.documentfoundation.org/">The Document Foundation</a> & PortableApps.com (<a href="/user/2">John T. Haller</a>)</li><li><strong>Date Updated</strong>: 2026-07-09</li><li><strong>Date Added</strong>: 2011-01-12</li><li><strong>System Requirements</strong>: Windows 8.1, 10, 11 & WINE (64-bit Only)</li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(<strong>Legacy Download</strong>: Windows 8.1/10/11 32-bit: <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-still">25.8.5</a>, Windows 7/8.0: <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-legacy-win7">25.2.7</a>, Windows XP/Vista: <a href="/apps/office/libreoffice-portable-legacy-5.4">5.4</a>)</li><li><strong>App License</strong>: Open Source (LGPL)</li><li><strong>Source</strong>: <a href="https://download.documentfoundation.org/libreoffice/src/">LibreOffice</a>, <a href="http://portableapps.com/apps/development/portableapps.com_launcher">PortableApps.com Launcher</a>, <a href="http://portableapps.com/apps/development/portableapps.com_installer">PortableApps.com Installer</a></li><li><strong>SHA256 Hash</strong>: 4bde93374aef4409243505b20d16561a4628ac7591457dd01fc6e1ccf571ba65, All: 297dd083640ec06679dd7996a16323308bdd92e641b9171c5ba2a27c52b5d4af</li></ul><p class="app-platform-blurb">LibreOffice Portable is packaged for portable use in conjunction with The Document Foundation</p></div></div></div>  <div id="book-navigation-1" class="book-navigation">
    
